            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.27.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 27:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.11.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 11:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Abisalomu wakaswanana abalanda baDavida, Kalitantide ambongolo, elyo imbongolo yakainda kunsi lyamitabi iivovwede yamusamu mupati, nkabela isusu lyakwe lyakajatwa omo mumusamu, aboobo wakasyaala kazumuka akatikati kajulu anyika, ambongolo njaakatantide yakaindilila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo umwi muntu wakamubona, waakulwiida Joabu makani. Wakati, Ncobeni ndabona Abisalomu ulazumuka mumusamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Joabu wakaambila oyo muntu iwakamulwiida makani kuti, Ma! Na wamubona, ino nkaambonzi nowatamuuma akumuwisya ansi mpoonya awo? Nowacita obo nongakupa mali aatuba aali ikumi alutambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino oyo muntu wakaambila Joabu kuti, Nowabika mumaanza aangu mali aali cuulu, nsikonzyi kutandabika ijanza lyangu cakujaya mwana wamwami, nkaambo mwami wakamulailila, uwe a-Abisai a-Itai, mumatwi esu, wakati, Kutabi muntu uubi sizya mulombe pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nondamucitila cakweena akumujaya, ncobeni taakwe cintu cisisidwe kumeso aamwami, nkabela uwe omwini nowanduumunina buyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
