              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Joabu wakalizya mweembo, nkabela bantu boonse bakaleka kutobela ba-Israyeli, nkaambo Joabu wakabakasya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
