        {
          "text": "Lino Abisalomu ciindi ncaakacili muumi wakayakide ciibalusyo mumumpata wamwami, nkaambo wakati, Nsijisi mwana wakwiibalusya izina lyangu, Eco ciibalusyo wakacibanda mbuli izina lyakwe, aboobo cicaambwa asunu kuti nciibalusyo ca-Abisalomu.",
          "type": "text",
