                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Ahimaazi mwana wa-Zadoki wakati, Nzuzaane kuyootolela mwami aya makani aakuti Jehova wamukoyekela basinkondonyina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele joabu wakamwaambila kuti, Pe, toelede kutola makani sunu, ulatola buzuba bumbi, Tokonzyi kutola makani buzuba obuno, nkaambo kakuti mwana wamwami wafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Joabu wakaambila mu-Kusi kuti, Koya uwe ukaambile mwami nciwabona, Elyo oyo mu-Kisi wakakotamina Joabu, wakainka bucijaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Ahimaazi mwana wa-Zadoki wakabuzya Joabu alwabili kuti, Taakwe makani. Nzuzaane ambebo kutobela mu-Kusi, joabu wakavuwa kuti, Ino nkaambonzi noyanda kuya, mwanaangu? Tojisi makani aakonzya kukujanina bulumbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati, Taakwe makani, njanda kuya, Wakati, Mbubo, koya. Mpawo Ahimaazi wakatola inzila yakunkanda, wakamweenzya mu-Kusi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
