          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpoonya awo Ahimaazi wakoonzomokela mwami, akumujuzya. Lino wakakotamina ansi kubusyu bwamwami, wakati, Alumbwe Jehova Leza wako, nkaambo abo bantu ibatambika maanza aabo kumwami simalelaangu wabaaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mwami wakabuzya kuti, Mulombe Abisalomu uli kabotu na? Ahimaazi wakavuwa kuti, Ciindi eco Joabu naakandituma ndemulanda wako, ndakabona lupyopyongano lupati, pele nsizi na cakaba anzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami wakati, Mbubo, ima awo, Elyo wakaima mpoonya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
