                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino wakasika mu-Ku si, wakati, Ndijisi makani, O mwami simalelaangu, nkaambo buzuba obuno Jehova wabeteka makani aako kubantu abo ibakakubisizya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo mwami wakabuzya mu-Kusi kuti, Mulombe Abisalomu uli kabotu na? Mu-Kusi wakati, Boonse basinkondonyina mwami simalelaangu abantu boonse balisumpula kukukubisizya, babe mbubonya mbwaabede oyo mulombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
